WEBVTT

00:08:58.196 --> 00:09:01.756
he was filled with his own longing
for another world.

00:09:01.796 --> 00:09:03.836
He'd grown up haunted by the Holocaust.

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:06.756
He used to lie awake at night
when he was 10 years old

00:09:06.796 --> 00:09:10.836
wondering would he have had the guts
to hide Anne Frank in his attic.

00:09:11.636 --> 00:09:14.436
And it turned out
that he did have the courage,

00:09:14.436 --> 00:09:18.396
even if his dreams of peace
never did come true.

00:09:18.396 --> 00:09:20.316
To this day, he keeps on his desk

00:09:20.316 --> 00:09:24.436
a photo of a pile of bones
from the Rwandan genocide.

00:09:26.076 --> 00:09:27.356
When we met,

00:09:27.356 --> 00:09:30.116
Ken was getting ready
to publish a book on his experiences,